<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43046" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐσχᾰτ-άω</span></b> , (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔσχατος</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>to be at the
				edge,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i> (only in <i><span class="en">
				Il.
			</span></i>) always in 
				Ep.
			
			part., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἴ τινά που δητων
				ἕλοι ἐσχατόωντα</span>
			<i>straying about the edge</i> of the camp, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				10.206
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀνθηδών, Μύρσινος ἐσχατόωσα,</span>
			<i>lying on the border,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				2.508
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				616
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἕσπερος ἐ.</span> the
				<i>extreme</i> west, <i><span class="en">
				Call.
				<u>Del.</u>
				174
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				7.77
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάρηνον ἐ.</span>”
				<i>sinciput,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arat.
					207
				</span></i>
			 : with a Verb, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τεχθήσεται ἐσχατόωσα</span>”
				<i>at last,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Man.
					4.459
				</span></i>
			.</div>
